{"id":"n14378-2-6","stage":3,"title":"덩어리 · 块","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14378-2-6-1","ko":"식빵을 얇게 썰어 드릴까요?","zh":"要我把吐司切成薄片吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"식빵을","meaning":"吐司面包","explanation":"식빵：吐司面包；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"식빵","audio":"/audio/4af4045bfc6ee1fd419a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65318","senseId":"1","lemma":"식빵","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얇게","meaning":"薄","explanation":"얇다：薄；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"얇다","audio":"/audio/7dbc70519003a2d1bb2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89859","senseId":"1","lemma":"얇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"썰어","meaning":"切，锯","explanation":"썰다：切，锯；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"썰다","audio":"/audio/0ca57aae18c4738f3675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29774","senseId":"1","lemma":"썰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드릴까요?","meaning":"(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。","explanation":"드리다：(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59252","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4af4045bfc6ee1fd","term":"식빵","zh":"吐司面包","audio":"/audio/4af4045bfc6ee1fd419a.mp3","entryId":"65318","definition":"就餐时食用的清淡的四方形面包。","pronunciation":["식빵"]},{"id":"7dbc70519003a2d1","term":"얇다","zh":"薄","audio":"/audio/7dbc70519003a2d1bb2d.mp3","entryId":"89859","definition":"厚度不厚。","pronunciation":["얄ː따"]},{"id":"0ca57aae18c4738f","term":"썰다","zh":"切，锯","audio":"/audio/0ca57aae18c4738f3675.mp3","entryId":"29774","definition":"用刀或锯向下摁并前后移动而将某物轧断或弄成许多块。","pronunciation":["썰ː다"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"59252","definition":"(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2fb7c79e26439a23fc38.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14378-2-6-2","ko":"아니요, 세 명이 나눠 먹을 거니까 세 덩어리로 잘라 주세요.","zh":"不用了，因为要三个人一起吃，所以请切成三块吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요,","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"세","meaning":"三","explanation":"세：三","readings":[{"term":"세","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17194","senseId":"1","lemma":"세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"명이","meaning":"个，名","explanation":"명：个，名；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"명","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70812","senseId":"1","lemma":"명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나눠","meaning":"一起吃，分享","explanation":"나누다：一起吃，分享；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"나누다","audio":"/audio/8a88d2ae9895b06ef350.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29749","senseId":"5","lemma":"나누다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹을","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거니까","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"세","meaning":"三","explanation":"세：三","readings":[{"term":"세","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17194","senseId":"1","lemma":"세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"덩어리로","meaning":"块，团","explanation":"덩어리：块，团；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"덩어리","audio":"/audio/dd1d80b6b914457b1745.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14378","senseId":"2","lemma":"덩어리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘라","meaning":"切断，剪，砍断","explanation":"자르다：切断，剪，砍断；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"자르다","audio":"/audio/1d818f15fdfd54e51260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17787","senseId":"1","lemma":"자르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9474acc7539b7e2c","term":"아니요","zh":"不是，不用","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3","entryId":"17189","definition":"用于否定回答长辈所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니요"]},{"id":"1bcc05bddb3c9e8c","term":"세","zh":"三","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3","entryId":"17194","definition":"三个的。","pronunciation":["세ː"]},{"id":"9f96b8e22cc06bfa","term":"명","zh":"个，名","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3","entryId":"70812","definition":"计算人数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["명"]},{"id":"8a88d2ae9895b06e","term":"나누다","zh":"一起吃，分享","audio":"/audio/8a88d2ae9895b06ef350.mp3","entryId":"29749","definition":"一同或分着吃食物。","pronunciation":["나누다"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"dd1d80b6b914457b","term":"덩어리","zh":"块，团","audio":"/audio/dd1d80b6b914457b1745.mp3","entryId":"14378","definition":"数体积大或结成一团的东西时使用的单位。","pronunciation":["덩어리"]},{"id":"1d818f15fdfd54e5","term":"자르다","zh":"切断，剪，砍断","audio":"/audio/1d818f15fdfd54e51260.mp3","entryId":"17787","definition":"割断物体或分成段截断其一部分。","pronunciation":["자르다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","